        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                "word": "balkanisation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1b645b20-876d-4e6d-a969-0769d01d39da",
                        "entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "balkanisations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e75828a-d916-319d-9642-e1ee49e6f165",
                        "entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Processus de morcellement d’un territoire en une multitude d’États."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd275bf7-000f-4cd4-a7b5-e959b897838c",
                                "sense_id": "9e75828a-d916-319d-9642-e1ee49e6f165",
                                "text": "L'État […]: ses structures et la légitimité de ses souverains sont attaqués du Levant à l'Asie du Sud-Ouest. Un conflit intérieur et son corollaire d'instabilité régionale peuvent donc faire craindre la balkanisation de la région et, par suite, une refonte de sa carte."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7ad1ff4-b1fb-40bd-b660-94d4e9e3090d",
                                "sense_id": "9e75828a-d916-319d-9642-e1ee49e6f165",
                                "text": "Au quotidien The Globe and Mail, à Toronto, les commentateurs grimpaient aux rideaux, montaient aux barricades, prédisaient l'érosion, la balkanisation imminente du Canada. Ici ? Presque rien, si peu, bof. Étonnant, non ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ba12477-fe46-4be3-ab9e-107b77f8b978",
                                "sense_id": "9e75828a-d916-319d-9642-e1ee49e6f165",
                                "text": "Qui la croirait aussi fragile, cette nation si constamment, si délibérément, une et indivisible ? C’est pourtant elle dont on annonce pour bientôt la balkanisation que lui promettent des communautés juxtaposées, concurrentielles, chacune s’avançant sous sa propre bannière."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7eb005c-dc18-330c-8dec-071adfadfc77",
                        "entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Processus de division d’un camp suite à des disputes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "65025be4-157a-39e1-878e-cac1ab252a9a",
                        "entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Processus d'éparpillement d’un patrimoine vers une multitude d'États."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e57801ce-bc90-4475-a315-764d1ae8f0fc",
                        "source_entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Balkanisierung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Balkanisierung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85d80267-16b0-3ed5-b356-c3390f70b185",
                                        "entry_id": "afbf492d-12e7-3541-a160-c86f1839bf08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "politisches Schlagwort, das für die Zerstückelung größerer politischer und wirtschaftlicher Gebilde steht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3394f208-a117-4f01-a59a-555d6bc51676",
                                                "sense_id": "85d80267-16b0-3ed5-b356-c3390f70b185",
                                                "text": "„Mit der Entstehung einer großen Anzahl von Staaten in Afrika im Zuge der Entkolonialisierung nach dem zweiten Weltkrieg sprachen Beobachter dieser Entwicklung häufig von einer Balkanisierung Afrikas.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0790b4a5-59d0-4d34-95e4-cc334d7422da",
                                                "sense_id": "85d80267-16b0-3ed5-b356-c3390f70b185",
                                                "text": "„Er bemerkte gar nicht, dass ein treffend «Plan Balkan» benannte Teilungsplan, der ihm nach einer Bearbeitung in London zugestellt wurde, in der Tat zu einer Balkanisierung Indiens geführt hätte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ad81d7c-f65d-462d-90b2-e04e6262047e",
                        "source_entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Balkanization",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Balkanization",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b86d79c0-42d3-3567-b224-4c4159cc01db",
                                        "entry_id": "0c6228e5-a9ba-3cf1-bbcb-ba192e70269c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fragmentation of a geopolitical region into several small states that are often hostile or non-cooperative with each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e6c6117-e983-3e32-a2ec-359aac0bdb3c",
                                        "entry_id": "0c6228e5-a9ba-3cf1-bbcb-ba192e70269c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any disintegration or fragmentation process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "285924f6-c42d-45b1-93a5-2ebfb30a4bbd",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6c6117-e983-3e32-a2ec-359aac0bdb3c",
                                                "text": "demographic balkanization"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a028463-085e-40df-ae5e-e84de0c6e71c",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6c6117-e983-3e32-a2ec-359aac0bdb3c",
                                                "text": "Issues that are already hotly contested become even more divisive in the context of social balkanization."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79cad8d7-4b56-4c07-b593-4c214bce9f6a",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6c6117-e983-3e32-a2ec-359aac0bdb3c",
                                                "text": "In other words, will the biometric future feature biometric centralization whereby one biometric would dominate multiple applications, or will we see biometric balkanization where multiple biometrics are used for multiple applications?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "781989da-b446-438b-82fd-4603387fe9b2",
                        "source_entry_id": "f055792e-603c-3f10-b27e-920e113d7b7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Balkanisation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Balkanisation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70b79c52-afaf-32b6-a970-871f93381de9",
                                        "entry_id": "67cbdb52-a117-393b-a95d-6064adbf5c70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Non-Oxford British English standard spelling of Balkanization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "nonstandard",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "004eb6aa-cbe3-43a6-b5fc-11df0bc843f7",
                                                "sense_id": "70b79c52-afaf-32b6-a970-871f93381de9",
                                                "text": "\"For myself, because of the baggage of 30 years of balkanisation, I think the elegant solution is to take operations back into the public sector. It will mean you can have a whole-industry approach to running the railway, unencumbered by contractual differences.\""
                                            }
